(132, 110, 'Business Partnership Agreement.pdf', '/uploads/sample.pdf', NULL, 'pdf', '2026-10-02 16:57:33', 'BUSINESS PARTNERSHIP AGREEMENT\n\nThis Business Partnership Agreement (the \"Agreement\") is made on [Effective Date] (the \"Effective Date\") between [Partner A Name], of [Partner A Address] (the \"Partner A\"), and [Partner B Name], of [Partner B Address] (the \"Partner B\").\n\nThe partners wish to carry on business together as a partnership under the name [Partnership Name].\n\n1. NAME AND PURPOSE\nThe partnership will operate as [Partnership Name] from [Principal Place of Business] for the purpose of [Business Purpose].\n\n2. CAPITAL CONTRIBUTIONS\nPartner A will contribute [Amount or Assets] and Partner B will contribute [Amount or Assets]. Additional contributions require the written agreement of all partners.\n\n3. PROFITS AND LOSSES\nNet profits and losses will be shared [50% Partner A and 50% Partner B], calculated at the end of each [financial year] after expenses and agreed reserves.\n\n4. MANAGEMENT AND DECISIONS\nEach partner has an equal say in day-to-day management. Decisions on borrowing above [Amount], admitting new partners, selling major assets or changing the business require unanimous written consent.\n\n5. BOOKS AND ACCOUNTS\nComplete books of account will be kept at the principal place of business and will be open to inspection by each partner at any reasonable time.\n\n6. WITHDRAWAL AND DISSOLUTION\nA partner may withdraw with [90] days\' written notice. The remaining partner may buy the withdrawing partner\'s share at fair value. On dissolution, assets are applied first to debts and then distributed according to capital accounts.\n\n7. ENTIRE AGREEMENT AND AMENDMENTS\nThis Agreement is the entire agreement between the parties about its subject and replaces all earlier proposals and discussions. It may be changed only in writing signed by both parties. If any provision is found unenforceable, the remaining provisions stay in full effect.\n\n8. GOVERNING LAW AND DISPUTES\nThis Agreement is governed by the laws of [Governing Jurisdiction]. The parties will first try to resolve any dispute in good faith; unresolved disputes will be decided by the courts of [Venue].\n\n9. ELECTRONIC SIGNATURES\nThe parties agree that this Agreement may be signed electronically through BexSign and in counterparts, and that each electronic signature has the same legal effect as a handwritten signature.\n\nSIGNATURES\nBy signing below, the Partner A and the Partner B agree to the terms of this Agreement.', '/uploads/completed/110/01-Business-Partnership-Agreement.pdf', 0, '{\"v\":1,\"width\":792,\"bodyKey\":\"1926:4a46e296\",\"pages\":[{\"height\":1142,\"texts\":[{\"t\":\"Business Partnership Agreement.pdf\",\"x\":56,\"y\":56,\"w\":344.89,\"h\":27,\"bl\":78,\"s\":20,\"c\":\"#0f172a\",\"b\":1},{\"t\":\"BexSign Document ID:\",\"x\":56,\"y\":87,\"w\":120.97,\"h\":13,\"bl\":97,\"s\":11,\"c\":\"#64748b\",\"m\":1},{\"t\":\"BEX-DOC-2026-0110-Y6623HDE-9GI8ZZUJB9821XVXMPST\",\"x\":183.02,\"y\":87,\"w\":284.25,\"h\":13,\"bl\":97,\"s\":11,\"c\":\"#64748b\",\"m\":1},{\"t\":\"BUSINESS PARTNERSHIP AGREEMENT\",\"x\":56,\"y\":132.5,\"w\":199.83,\"h\":16,\"bl\":145.5,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"This Business Partnership Agreement (the \\\"Agreement\\\") is made on [Effective Date] (the \\\"Effective Date\\\") between [Partner A\",\"x\":56,\"y\":171.5,\"w\":655.92,\"h\":16,\"bl\":184.5,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"Name], of [Partner A Address] (the \\\"Partner A\\\"), and [Partner B Name], of [Partner B Address] (the \\\"Partner B\\\").\",\"x\":56,\"y\":191,\"w\":578.02,\"h\":16,\"bl\":204,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"The partners wish to carry on business together as a partnership under the name [Partnership Name].\",\"x\":56,\"y\":230,\"w\":534.2,\"h\":16,\"bl\":243,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"1. NAME AND PURPOSE\",\"x\":56,\"y\":269,\"w\":127.98,\"h\":16,\"bl\":282,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"The partnership will operate as [Partnership Name] from [Principal Place of Business] for the purpose of [Business Purpose].\",\"x\":56,\"y\":288.5,\"w\":649.11,\"h\":16,\"bl\":301.5,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"2. CAPITAL CONTRIBUTIONS\",\"x\":56,\"y\":327.5,\"w\":150.38,\"h\":16,\"bl\":340.5,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"Partner A will contribute [Amount or Assets] and Partner B will contribute [Amount or Assets]. Additional contributions require\",\"x\":56,\"y\":347,\"w\":664.64,\"h\":16,\"bl\":360,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"the written agreement of all partners.\",\"x\":56,\"y\":366.5,\"w\":196.92,\"h\":16,\"bl\":379.5,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"3. PROFITS AND LOSSES\",\"x\":56,\"y\":405.5,\"w\":127.86,\"h\":16,\"bl\":418.5,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"Net profits and losses will be shared [50% Partner A and 50% Partner B], calculated at the end of each [financial year] after\",\"x\":56,\"y\":425,\"w\":643.16,\"h\":16,\"bl\":438,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"expenses and agreed reserves.\",\"x\":56,\"y\":444.5,\"w\":160.86,\"h\":16,\"bl\":457.5,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"4. MANAGEMENT AND DECISIONS\",\"x\":56,\"y\":483.5,\"w\":184.55,\"h\":16,\"bl\":496.5,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"Each partner has an equal say in day-to-day management. Decisions on borrowing above [Amount], admitting new partners,\",\"x\":56,\"y\":503,\"w\":656.84,\"h\":16,\"bl\":516,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"selling major assets or changing the business require unanimous written consent.\",\"x\":56,\"y\":522.5,\"w\":429.02,\"h\":16,\"bl\":535.5,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"5. BOOKS AND ACCOUNTS\",\"x\":56,\"y\":561.5,\"w\":142.8,\"h\":16,\"bl\":574.5,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"Complete books of account will be kept at the principal place of business and will be open to inspection by each partner at any\",\"x\":56,\"y\":581,\"w\":670.89,\"h\":16,\"bl\":594,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"reasonable time.\",\"x\":56,\"y\":600.5,\"w\":87.28,\"h\":16,\"bl\":613.5,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"6. WITHDRAWAL AND DISSOLUTION\",\"x\":56,\"y\":639.5,\"w\":194.48,\"h\":16,\"bl\":652.5,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"A partner may withdraw with [90] days\' written notice. The remaining partner may buy the withdrawing partner\'s share at fair\",\"x\":56,\"y\":659,\"w\":658.77,\"h\":16,\"bl\":672,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"value. On dissolution, assets are applied first to debts and then distributed according to capital accounts.\",\"x\":56,\"y\":678.5,\"w\":553.08,\"h\":16,\"bl\":691.5,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"7. ENTIRE AGREEMENT AND AMENDMENTS\",\"x\":56,\"y\":717.5,\"w\":232.53,\"h\":16,\"bl\":730.5,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"This Agreement is the entire agreement between the parties about its subject and replaces all earlier proposals and discussions.\",\"x\":56,\"y\":737,\"w\":672.91,\"h\":16,\"bl\":750,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"It may be changed only in writing signed by both parties. If any provision is found unenforceable, the remaining provisions stay\",\"x\":56,\"y\":756.5,\"w\":671.88,\"h\":16,\"bl\":769.5,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"in full effect.\",\"x\":56,\"y\":776,\"w\":64.91,\"h\":16,\"bl\":789,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"8. GOVERNING LAW AND DISPUTES\",\"x\":56,\"y\":815,\"w\":190.23,\"h\":16,\"bl\":828,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"This Agreement is governed by the laws of [Governing Jurisdiction]. The parties will first try to resolve any dispute in good faith;\",\"x\":56,\"y\":834.5,\"w\":672.63,\"h\":16,\"bl\":847.5,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"unresolved disputes will be decided by the courts of [Venue].\",\"x\":56,\"y\":854,\"w\":321.14,\"h\":16,\"bl\":867,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"9. ELECTRONIC SIGNATURES\",\"x\":56,\"y\":893,\"w\":150.67,\"h\":16,\"bl\":906,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"The parties agree that this Agreement may be signed electronically through BexSign and in counterparts, and that each\",\"x\":56,\"y\":912.5,\"w\":629.34,\"h\":16,\"bl\":925.5,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"electronic signature has the same legal effect as a handwritten signature.\",\"x\":56,\"y\":932,\"w\":384.39,\"h\":16,\"bl\":945,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"SIGNATURES\",\"x\":56,\"y\":971,\"w\":67.81,\"h\":16,\"bl\":984,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"By signing below, the Partner A and the Partner B agree to the terms of this Agreement.\",\"x\":56,\"y\":990.5,\"w\":462.39,\"h\":16,\"bl\":1003.5,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"}],\"rects\":[{\"x\":56,\"y\":1033,\"w\":680,\"h\":1,\"c\":\"#e2e8f0\",\"f\":1},{\"x\":56,\"y\":114.5,\"w\":680,\"h\":1,\"c\":\"#e2e8f0\",\"f\":1}],\"images\":[]},{\"height\":1121,\"texts\":[{\"t\":\"Business Partnership Agreement.pdf\",\"x\":56,\"y\":58,\"w\":310.41,\"h\":24,\"bl\":77,\"s\":18,\"c\":\"#0f172a\",\"b\":1},{\"t\":\"Execution & Signatures • Page\",\"x\":56,\"y\":87,\"w\":175.39,\"h\":13,\"bl\":97,\"s\":11,\"c\":\"#64748b\",\"m\":1},{\"t\":\"2\",\"x\":237.44,\"y\":87,\"w\":6.06,\"h\":13,\"bl\":97,\"s\":11,\"c\":\"#64748b\",\"m\":1},{\"t\":\"of\",\"x\":249.55,\"y\":87,\"w\":12.11,\"h\":13,\"bl\":97,\"s\":11,\"c\":\"#64748b\",\"m\":1},{\"t\":\"2\",\"x\":267.7,\"y\":87,\"w\":6.06,\"h\":13,\"bl\":97,\"s\":11,\"c\":\"#64748b\",\"m\":1},{\"t\":\"IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the parties hereto have executed this Agreement by affixing their digital signatures and requested\",\"x\":56,\"y\":115.5,\"w\":644.09,\"h\":16,\"bl\":128.5,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#475569\"},{\"t\":\"verification fields below.\",\"x\":56,\"y\":135,\"w\":127.33,\"h\":16,\"bl\":148,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#475569\"}],\"rects\":[{\"x\":56,\"y\":169.5,\"w\":680,\"h\":1,\"c\":\"#e2e8f0\",\"f\":1}],\"images\":[]}]}'),
(136, 118, 'Consulting Agreement.pdf', '/uploads/sample.pdf', NULL, 'pdf', '2026-10-02 17:23:17', 'CONSULTING AGREEMENT\n\nThis Consulting Agreement (the \"Agreement\") is made on [Effective Date] (the \"Effective Date\") between [Company Name], of [Company Address] (the \"Company\"), and [Consultant Name], of [Consultant Address] (the \"Consultant\").\n\n1. CONSULTING SERVICES\nThe Consultant will provide the following consulting services: [Description of Services], including the deliverables listed in any attached statement of work.\n\n2. FEES AND EXPENSES\nThe Company will pay the Consultant [Rate] per [hour, day or project], invoiced [monthly]. Reasonable pre-approved expenses will be reimbursed on submission of receipts.\n\n3. INDEPENDENT CONTRACTOR\nThe Consultant is an independent contractor and not an employee, and is responsible for their own taxes, insurance and equipment. The Consultant has no authority to bind the Company.\n\n4. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY\nAll work product created for the Company under this Agreement belongs to the Company upon payment. The Consultant keeps ownership of pre-existing tools and know-how and grants the Company a licence to use them as part of the deliverables.\n\n5. CONFIDENTIALITY\nEach party will keep the other party\'s non-public business, technical and financial information confidential, use it only to perform this Agreement, and protect it with at least reasonable care.\n\n6. TERM AND TERMINATION\nThis Agreement starts on [Start Date] and ends on [End Date] unless terminated earlier by either party with [14] days\' written notice.\n\n7. ENTIRE AGREEMENT AND AMENDMENTS\nThis Agreement is the entire agreement between the parties about its subject and replaces all earlier proposals and discussions. It may be changed only in writing signed by both parties. If any provision is found unenforceable, the remaining provisions stay in full effect.\n\n8. GOVERNING LAW AND DISPUTES\nThis Agreement is governed by the laws of [Governing Jurisdiction]. The parties will first try to resolve any dispute in good faith; unresolved disputes will be decided by the courts of [Venue].\n\n9. ELECTRONIC SIGNATURES\nThe parties agree that this Agreement may be signed electronically through BexSign and in counterparts, and that each electronic signature has the same legal effect as a handwritten signature.\n\nSIGNATURES\nBy signing below, the Company and the Consultant agree to the terms of this Agreement.', '/uploads/completed/118/01-Consulting-Agreement.pdf', 0, '{\"v\":1,\"width\":792,\"bodyKey\":\"1875:c4fe4c21\",\"pages\":[{\"height\":1123,\"texts\":[{\"t\":\"Consulting Agreement.pdf\",\"x\":56,\"y\":56,\"w\":250.3,\"h\":27,\"bl\":78,\"s\":20,\"c\":\"#0f172a\",\"b\":1},{\"t\":\"BexSign Document ID:\",\"x\":56,\"y\":87,\"w\":120.97,\"h\":13,\"bl\":97,\"s\":11,\"c\":\"#64748b\",\"m\":1},{\"t\":\"BEX-DOC-2026-0118-X1C3D9BP-3LWW16H6TBBAOS1SII9FFC\",\"x\":183.02,\"y\":87,\"w\":296.36,\"h\":13,\"bl\":97,\"s\":11,\"c\":\"#64748b\",\"m\":1},{\"t\":\"CONSULTING AGREEMENT\",\"x\":56,\"y\":132.5,\"w\":141.73,\"h\":16,\"bl\":145.5,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"This Consulting Agreement (the \\\"Agreement\\\") is made on [Effective Date] (the \\\"Effective Date\\\") between [Company Name], of\",\"x\":56,\"y\":171.5,\"w\":661.77,\"h\":16,\"bl\":184.5,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"[Company Address] (the \\\"Company\\\"), and [Consultant Name], of [Consultant Address] (the \\\"Consultant\\\").\",\"x\":56,\"y\":191,\"w\":553.03,\"h\":16,\"bl\":204,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"1. CONSULTING SERVICES\",\"x\":56,\"y\":230,\"w\":137.06,\"h\":16,\"bl\":243,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"The Consultant will provide the following consulting services: [Description of Services], including the deliverables listed in any\",\"x\":56,\"y\":249.5,\"w\":660.22,\"h\":16,\"bl\":262.5,\"s\":12,\"c\":\"#334155\"},{\"t\":\"attached statement of work.\",\"x\":56,\"y\":269,\"w\":148.19,\"h\":16,\"bl\":282,\"s\":12,\"