(137, 119, 'Statement of Work (SOW).pdf', '/uploads/sample.pdf', NULL, 'pdf', '2026-10-02 17:25:59', 'STATEMENT OF WORK (SOW)\n\nThis Statement of Work (\"SOW\") is entered into on [Effective Date] under the [Master Service Agreement] dated [MSA Date] between [Customer Name] (the \"Customer\") and [Provider Name] (the \"Provider\").\n\n1. PROJECT OVERVIEW\n[Short description of the project, its objectives and expected business outcome.]\n\n2. SCOPE OF WORK\nIn scope: [List of activities].\nOut of scope: [List of exclusions].\n\n3. DELIVERABLES AND MILESTONES\nMilestone 1: [Deliverable] - due [Date]\nMilestone 2: [Deliverable] - due [Date]\nMilestone 3: [Deliverable] - due [Date]\n\n4. FEES AND PAYMENT SCHEDULE\nTotal fees: [Amount and Currency], payable as follows: [Percentage] on signature, [Percentage] on Milestone 2 and [Percentage] on final acceptance.\n\n5. ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA\nEach deliverable is accepted when it meets the following criteria: [Acceptance Criteria]. The Customer will confirm acceptance within [5] business days of delivery.\n\n6. ASSUMPTIONS AND DEPENDENCIES\n[Assumptions, customer dependencies and resources the Customer will provide.]\n\n7. PROJECT CONTACTS\nCustomer contact: [Name, Email]\nProvider contact: [Name, Email]\n\nSIGNATURES\nThis SOW is governed by the Master Service Agreement. By signing below, the parties agree to this SOW.', '/uploads/completed/119/01-Statement-of-Work-SOW.pdf', 0, '{\"v\":1,\"width\":792,\"bodyKey\":\"960:52fc956c\",\"pages\":[{\"height\":1121,\"texts\":[{\"t\":\"Statement of Work (SOW).pdf\",\"x\":56,\"y\":56,\"w\":285.73,\"h\":27,\"bl\":78,\"s\":20,\"c\":\"#0f172a\",\"b\":1},{\"t\":\"BexSign Document ID:\",\"x\":56,\"y\":87,\"w\":120.97,\"h\":13,\"bl\":97,\"s\":11,\"c\":\"#64748b\",\"m\":1},{\"t\":\"BEX-DOC-2026-0119-594MRVH4-81GNYAW02ZG35P236GHWU\",\"x\":183.02,\"y\":87,\"w\":290.3,\"h\":13,\"bl\":97,\"s\":11,\"c\":\"#64748b\",\"m\":1},{\"t\":\"STATEMENT OF WORK (SOW)\",\"x\":56,\"y\":132.5,\"w\":155.94,\"h\"